{"about_the_game":"<strong>A dark comedy horror game with a N64 aesthetic.</strong><br><br>Originally created for <u>The Dread X Collection 4</u>, <strong>Uktena 64 - Ultimate</strong> is a shiny new re-release with<br>extended features and brand new additional campaign.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/fd2f7f3aeafd6d4fe66f4249601a6fd9.poster.avif?t=1769268348\" width=642 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/fd2f7f3aeafd6d4fe66f4249601a6fd9.webm?t=1769268348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/fd2f7f3aeafd6d4fe66f4249601a6fd9.mp4?t=1769268348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jebadiah gets a strange call with a job offer from the CDC.<br>Diseased animals are spreading a deadly unknown virus and must be stopped. Jebs got to hunt them down and take photos of their eerie bodily corruptions as evidence.<br><br><i>(New campaign with Ultimate)</i><br>While Jeb is off hunting, his brother Jeeb gets a similar bounty.<br>The CIA wants any infected animals hunted down and the bodies destroyed. Jeeb\u2019s got just the bright idea, He\u2019ll hunt these critters down and then use their meat for his failing BBQ restaurant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/e0c5190ca9de416e5b1a0556742ff682.poster.avif?t=1769268348\" width=642 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/e0c5190ca9de416e5b1a0556742ff682.webm?t=1769268348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121400/extras/e0c5190ca9de416e5b1a0556742ff682.mp4?t=1769268348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Uktena 64 - Ultimate</strong> you\u2019ll find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Atmospheric hunting, in diverse low-poly locales.<br></li><li>Multiple difficulties from super easy to not even balanced.<br></li><li>A couple silly goofballs as playable characters.<br></li><li>Unlockable cheat codes that let you fully break the game.<br></li><li>Strange horrors beyond human imagining.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"DK MODE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/da8ea8f16edab37e82c1e56c9b7d4766e58ddae3.jpg"},{"name":"ALL WEAPONS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/1f076bbca36c4ba4b64022c56a16bcc35a36e7b8.jpg"},{"name":"CRISIS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/5b9983b8992e8f7e0c932377d07abb378e6fc0a3.jpg"},{"name":"HUMAN FLY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/54411d4eb0895e966fbdf81e6d2f6b5dd938c13a.jpg"},{"name":"CATFISH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/ef7903a9113c3342b71534c94760d79e525ad645.jpg"},{"name":"ZOO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/eb7f9694a9daf0cad2f8839643087d51553e2952.jpg"},{"name":"DOG FOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/fbc282ced6d6072bdbc0a1f765e2d51ea61e7476.jpg"},{"name":"POG","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/dfadf89c74be8c901f7f9454440f45b17e077056.jpg"},{"name":"THE BUTCHER OF WOLFE HOLLOW","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4121400/61da8fcf9775b161ccaea5803f1b2022875bb683.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing Wasted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a